NOTE ON DATA AND TERMINOLOGIES

This licence covers the source code in this repository. It does not cover the
data the pipeline downloads, nor the terminologies that data contains.

  - FDA FAERS/LAERS quarterly extracts are a work of the US federal
    government and are in the public domain.

  - Derived result tables produced by this pipeline are released under
    CC BY 4.0. See DATASET_CARD.md.

  - Reaction terms are MedDRA Preferred Terms, owned by IFPMA and maintained
    by the MSSO. They reach this project through FDA's public release. A
    licence granted here cannot and does not extend to them. MedDRA
    subscriptions are free of charge for non-profit, non-commercial and
    academic use.

  - Drug identifiers are RxNorm (US National Library of Medicine), public
    domain.
